@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title UI/UX Handoff and Implementation Evidence
start
:Select MVP task and exact requirement criteria;
:Identify actor, resource owner and governing decision;
:Package flow, wireframe, screen states,
content, accessibility and responsive rules;
:Map controls to React / Inertia and server contracts;
if (Dependent policy / design input unresolved?) then (yes)
 :Record gap, owner and affected implementation scope;
 :Resolve before relying on that behavior;
else (no)
endif
:Implement separately authorized slice with owner-local boundaries;
:Verify normal, denied, stale, pending
and interrupted paths as applicable;
:Review actual UI, accessibility and contract behavior;
if (Mismatch or failed criterion?) then (yes)
 :Record finding and correct owning design / implementation;
 :Retest affected behavior and shared patterns;
else (no)
 :Link actual revision and evidence;
endif
:Update RTM, work item and remaining limitations;
stop
@enduml
